WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.437 --> 00:00:03.037
Lesson fourteen. Sports!

2
00:00:04.016 --> 00:00:11.066
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:11.976 --> 00:00:13.622
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.672 --> 00:00:16.670
Today we learn: Sports! Let's go!

5
00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:22.170
Football! Say it with me. Football!

6
00:00:26.238 --> 00:00:30.504
Basketball! Say it with me. Basketball!

7
00:00:34.461 --> 00:00:37.794
Swim! Say it with me. Swim!

8
00:00:41.877 --> 00:00:45.611
Run! Say it with me. Run!

9
00:00:49.527 --> 00:00:52.810
Jump! Say it with me. Jump!

10
00:00:56.863 --> 00:01:00.297
Ball! Say it with me. Ball!

11
00:01:04.238 --> 00:01:07.755
Team! Say it with me. Team!

12
00:01:11.816 --> 00:01:15.250
Win! Say it with me. Win!

13
00:01:19.265 --> 00:01:25.682
Listen. I can play football. I can swim.

14
00:01:25.732 --> 00:01:30.579
Say it with me. I can play football. I can swim.

15
00:01:35.426 --> 00:01:41.290
My team likes to play football and basketball. We run, jump, and try to win.

16
00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:42.733
I like this story!

17
00:01:43.486 --> 00:01:47.969
What can you do?

18
00:01:48.019 --> 00:01:49.319
I can swim!

19
00:01:50.492 --> 00:01:54.830
What's this?

20
00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:56.122
It's a ball!

21
00:01:57.056 --> 00:02:01.789
X. Listen for X at the end: fox, box!

22
00:02:05.783 --> 00:02:12.958
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

23
00:02:13.008 --> 00:02:14.700
Bye-bye, friends!

